+### User transfer
+
+- Only an org admin of the organization in the path may transfer its users. Caller in another org → 404; same org but not admin → 403.
+- The target user must belong to the path organization → 404. Transferring to the organization they are already in → 409. Unknown target organization → 400.
+- On transfer the user's `org_admin` flag is cleared, and their project memberships in the old organization are kept but stop granting access (projects are only readable within their own organization).
